11. Complete Touchstone Workflow
====================================================================

1. Create an Environment.
2. Select Kubernetes or OpenStack.
3. Create a custom Test Suite.
4. Add the required Test Cases.
5. Configure execution parameters.
6. Execute the Test Suite.
7. Monitor execution using Grafana.
8. View execution reports.
9. Analyze graphs and benchmark results.
10. Compare results with reference benchmark suites.
